# StreamVersion 1.2
# The model is over --max-size, so it is skipped and a message offers "Load it anyway", whose
# command carries the file's absolute path. On Windows that path is full of backslashes, which the
# command tokenizer reads as escapes: spliced in as-is, the path arrived without its separators and
# the file was never found. Clicking the action has to load the model, on screen (PRESENTED).
RenderEvent 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
TimerEvent 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
TimerEvent 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
TimerEvent 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
TimerEvent 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
TimerEvent 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
# Click "Load it anyway" on the message
MouseMoveEvent 579 36 0 0 0 0 0
TimerEvent 579 36 0 0 0 0 0
TimerEvent 579 36 0 0 0 0 0
TimerEvent 579 36 0 0 0 0 0
LeftButtonPressEvent 579 36 0 0 0 0 0
TimerEvent 579 36 0 0 0 0 0
